<view class="page register-page"><view class="page-title">准备好，和大家打个招呼。</view><view class="subtitle">可以先浏览。完成核验后，再参与分享、回应和报名。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在查看账号状态…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="error-box"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="btn btn-secondary" bindtap="refresh">重新加载</button></view><block wx:else><view wx:if="{{mode === 'demo'}}" class="demo-label">本机演示 · 模拟核验，不采集真实手机号</view><view class="registration-card card"><view class="verification-symbol">{{isVerified ? '✓' : '✳'}}</view><view class="verification-title">{{isVerified ? (mode === 'demo' ? '已完成演示模拟核验' : '手机号已核验') : (mode === 'demo' ? '体验一次模拟注册' : '使用微信授权核验手机号')}}</view><view class="verification-description">{{mode === 'demo' ? '演示标记只保存在当前设备，不代表真实手机号已核验。' : '通过微信授权核验手机号，号码不会在公开社区或主页展示。'}}</view><view wx:if="{{maskedPhone}}" class="masked-phone">{{maskedPhone}}</view><view wx:if="{{isVerified}}" class="completed-note">可以返回刚才的页面，继续完成你的操作。</view><block wx:else><view class="agreement-box"><view class="agreement-selection" bindtap="toggleConsent"><text class="consent-check {{consentAccepted ? 'checked' : ''}}">{{consentAccepted ? '✓' : ''}}</text><text>我已阅读并同意</text></view><view class="policy-links"><text bindtap="policy" data-type="terms">《用户协议》</text><text bindtap="policy" data-type="privacy">《隐私说明》</text></view><view class="policy-version">版本：{{termsVersion || '待配置'}} / {{privacyVersion || '待配置'}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{verificationError}}" class="verification-error">{{verificationError}}<button class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="refresh" disabled="{{busy}}">刷新核验信息</button></view><view wx:if="{{!versionsReady}}" class="configuration-note">协议版本尚未配置，暂时不能完成核验。</view><button wx:elif="{{mode === 'demo'}}" class="btn btn-primary verify-button" bindtap="demoVerify" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !consentAccepted}}">模拟手机号核验（不采集真实手机号）</button><view wx:elif="{{!policyConfigured}}" class="configuration-note">运营方尚未完成正式政策配置，暂时不能授权手机号。你可以先浏览，稍后重新查看。</view><button wx:elif="{{phoneEnabled}}" class="btn btn-primary verify-button" open-type="getPhoneNumber" bindgetphonenumber="phoneNumber" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !consentAccepted}}">授权微信手机号并完成核验</button><view wx:else class="configuration-note">运营方尚未完成真实手机号核验配置，当前不能注册参与互动。你仍可以浏览公开内容。</view></block></view><view class="registration-note">核验信息只用于账号管理，公开交流仍使用昵称。完成核验后，请返回原页面确认操作。</view><button class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="continueBrowsing" disabled="{{busy}}">{{isVerified ? '返回继续使用' : '先继续浏览'}}</button><view wx:if="{{fromAction}}" class="draft-note">刚才页面的草稿会保留，核验后请回去确认并再次提交。</view></block></view>
